Third-party software
--------------------

The Element module bundle (packages/mxblocks-element/, built as mxblocks-rich.js) includes:

  - KaTeX (https://katex.org), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2013-2020
    Khan Academy and other contributors. Its fonts are bundled with it
    under the same license.
  - React is NOT bundled; the module uses the host application's copy.

The math renderer (packages/mxblocks-math/, the mxblocks-math program) depends on:

  - mathjax-full (https://www.mathjax.org), Apache License 2.0,
    Copyright (c) 2009-2023 The MathJax Consortium.

At runtime the math renderer invokes, as a separate program (not linked
or distributed with it), resvg (MPL-2.0) and uses DejaVu fonts (Bitstream
Vera / DejaVu license). The Nix package wires these in; they keep their
own licenses.

